  "glyphObservationVerification": "repeatability.json",
  "glyphAtlasContext": "Original default-font glyphs observed after stable native select frames. Every glyph is rendered in a fitting title before observation. Independent observer-disabled launch has identical decoded RGBA pixels. Popup uses the original language-selection list and entries; dropdown behavior is a web composition."
